WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.672 --> 00:00:03.339
- I'm ready for this.

00:00:06.841 --> 00:00:11.619
("Have a Goon One" by
Warner/Chappell Productions)

00:00:20.122 --> 00:00:22.106
- Right now we're at
Stronghold Bouldering,

00:00:22.106 --> 00:00:24.528
we're about to do some rock
climbing, or bouldering.

00:00:24.604 --> 00:00:27.129
- Nobody else was around
except for Ryan and Shane,

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:31.216
so I'm here as a Test Guest,
or a guestie, if you will.

00:00:31.524 --> 00:00:32.823
- I've climbed a whole bunch of ladders,

00:00:32.823 --> 00:00:34.071
whole bunch of stairs.

00:00:34.332 --> 00:00:36.952
Vertical ascension, I'm pretty good at it.

00:00:37.101 --> 00:00:38.056
I don't know about this though.

00:00:38.056 --> 00:00:39.097
- We're all also trying to see who can

00:00:39.097 --> 00:00:40.239
climb the wall the fastest.

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:41.896
I see Jordan right there behind camera.

00:00:42.436 --> 00:00:43.987
If I can beat her I'll be happy

00:00:43.987 --> 00:00:45.542
because she's a Megatron.

00:00:45.617 --> 00:00:47.458
- I don't think I'm scared of heights.

00:00:47.458 --> 00:00:48.800
I'll find out when I get to the top.

00:00:48.867 --> 00:00:51.370
- The boys are already gonna
hurt themselves behind you.

00:00:56.650 --> 00:00:58.062
What makes a good rock climber?

00:00:58.062 --> 00:01:02.241
- You want to try and use
your legs as much as you can.

00:01:02.241 --> 00:01:02.868
- Okay.

00:01:02.868 --> 00:01:04.891
- You're gonna get the most
strength from your legs.

00:01:04.891 --> 00:01:05.757
- Really?

00:01:05.757 --> 00:01:06.816
- People forget that a lot.

00:01:07.636 --> 00:01:11.995
(cheery music)

00:01:16.127 --> 00:01:17.148
- Who do you think is
gonna do the best here,

00:01:17.148 --> 00:01:19.604
Gumby, Xena, or me?

00:01:20.511 --> 00:01:21.415
- It's hard to say.

00:01:21.415 --> 00:01:23.196
- Why do you not get a weird nickname?

00:01:23.196 --> 00:01:25.153
- Okay, Dopey, how about Dopey?

00:01:25.298 --> 00:01:26.231
- That's a good one.

00:01:26.591 --> 00:01:29.704
(violin music)

00:01:29.988 --> 00:01:31.185
- [Ryan] Look at his legs.

00:01:31.845 --> 00:01:33.247
- [Jordan] He's like a
little spider monkey.

00:01:39.957 --> 00:01:41.947
- I don't know where my
little feet are going.

00:01:47.029 --> 00:01:48.868
- [Jordan] Look how long his legs are.

00:01:50.702 --> 00:01:53.079
- [Ryan] This isn't
fair, he has spider legs.

00:01:55.907 --> 00:01:57.650
- [Jordan] He needs to
get a height handicap.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:58.569
- [Shane] No, no, no.

00:01:58.569 --> 00:02:00.411
- Ryan and I need a height handicap.

00:02:00.411 --> 00:02:02.083
- I worked very hard to be this tall.

00:02:02.353 --> 00:02:06.187
(orchestral music)

00:02:21.993 --> 00:02:23.455
- Ahh, done.

00:02:24.295 --> 00:02:25.209
What'd I get get?

00:02:25.209 --> 00:02:26.178
How'd I do?

00:02:26.178 --> 00:02:28.227
- I stopped at 19.46, when
you were right around there.

00:02:28.227 --> 00:02:29.381
- 19.46, I beat Shane.

00:02:32.351 --> 00:02:37.181
(Dark orchestral music)

00:02:46.281 --> 00:02:47.289
- [Jordan] Woah Ryan.

00:02:47.289 --> 00:02:48.243
- [Shane] Ryan.

00:02:48.737 --> 00:02:50.311
10.7.
- 10 seconds!

00:02:51.639 --> 00:02:53.877
- I'd like to thank my mom, my dad

00:02:53.877 --> 00:02:55.318
for helping me get to this moment.

00:02:55.318 --> 00:02:57.142
- Ryan is secretly an expert rock climber.

00:02:57.142 --> 00:02:59.118
- Shane and Jordan for being inferior.

00:02:59.418 --> 00:03:01.594
("Have a Goon One" by
Warner/Chappell Productions)

00:03:01.954 --> 00:03:03.458
- This is probably the
hardest bouldering one,

00:03:03.458 --> 00:03:04.479
or one of the harder ones.

00:03:06.257 --> 00:03:08.186
And we're gonna end poorly.

00:03:11.004 --> 00:03:12.066
- Ouch! (laughs)

00:03:12.374 --> 00:03:13.968
- That went great, it was a lot of fun.

00:03:13.968 --> 00:03:15.131
This is definitely something I can

00:03:15.131 --> 00:03:16.455
see myself doing in the future.

00:03:16.483 --> 00:03:19.295
- Right now my forearms and
my hands are very tired.

00:03:21.848 --> 00:03:24.155
- I did about as well as I expected.

00:03:24.575 --> 00:03:26.698
I succeeded on a few them,

00:03:26.698 --> 00:03:28.209
and then on the other
ones I just fell off.

00:03:29.169 --> 00:03:31.119
Sometimes it's a choice.

00:03:31.499 --> 00:03:32.998
(Jordan laughs)

00:03:33.027 --> 00:03:35.838
- I'm kinda pissed that Ryan
was so naturally good at this

00:03:35.838 --> 00:03:37.839
because I really wanted to beat him today,

00:03:37.839 --> 00:03:40.312
but I'm also glad that he
maybe found a new calling.

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:41.827
- This is something that I would do

00:03:41.827 --> 00:03:43.377
probably multiple times a week.

00:03:43.429 --> 00:03:46.536
Cause you're just climbing shit, it's fun.

